              "content": "={{ $json.category_prompt }}\n\n{{ $json.few_shot_context }}\n\nYou must base your response ONLY on the sources provided. Do not use prior knowledge.\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with exactly these fields:\n- insight: 2-3 sentence summary grounded in the sources\n- recommended_action: one specific actionable recommendation\n- sources_used: array of the source URLs provided\nNo markdown, no explanation, just the JSON object."
            },
